      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okolimok nai Ekapolon ayoŋ tema, “Nyilip neni kaŋ aŋuna ka akiŋarakin ŋituŋa lu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari kiredakis ikes akiron, nyeirari ayoŋ akigworo kec, tari keyaut ikes neni kaŋ ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ka ŋainakineta ŋuna a ŋikinyom, nyacamuni ayoŋ ŋainakineta kec, nai aari ayoŋ ikes a ekileŋ, a akoro ka a ŋidekesinei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitoroniyarae ŋikadwarak ŋulu alyokonok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olimu nai ayoŋ otema, “Okoe, Ekapolon Akuj! Ŋikadwarak lu ŋulu elimonokinete ŋituŋa ebe, ‘Nyikiaryo iyes a ekileŋ, kori nyiyakaunotor iyes eron, nai akainakini ayoŋ iyes ekisil ŋolo a kire anakibois a na.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon okolimok ayoŋ tema, “Edwarete ŋikadwarak alyokonu enyarito ekiro kaŋ, nyeyakit ayoŋ ikes, kori nyetemara ayoŋ ikes kirworo ŋun, kori nyirworo ayoŋ neni kec. Edwarete ikes neni kon ŋakisileerenokineta ŋuna ka alyoko, edwarete ikes ŋakiro ŋunacaryo ka amodiyo ŋina eyai natameta kec a ŋikulepek.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun irworo Ekapolon aŋuna a ŋikadwarak a ŋulu edwarete enyarito ekiro kaŋ atemar tari ŋina pa eyakitor ayoŋ ikes ŋulu ebasi, “Nyikiaryo a ekileŋ ka nyebuni eron nakwap na.” Earyo ŋikadwarak ŋul a ekileŋ ka etwakete aŋuna a eron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu edwarete ikes ŋakiro kec, imasaryo kiŋa lorotin ŋulu a Yerusalem, erae ŋulu earit akoro ka ekileŋ, emamukaun ituŋanan ŋini enuki ikes, itiyakin ŋakiro ŋun neni kec a daadaŋ ka neni a ŋaberu kec neni a ŋidwe kec a ŋulusapa ta neni a ŋidwe kec a ŋulupesur, anerae esitiyae ayoŋ aronis kec akisicania ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
